⚡🇮🇹 An email triggered a bomb alert in hundreds of schools this morning in Italy. The email communications were reportedly sent to school principals, announcing the presence of a device in the school complex. Security protocols were thus activated. Checks have been initiated. Several alerts have already been cleared as false.

According to reports the email was signed by a self-proclaimed Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps, which claimed to have left a plastic bag containing explosives that they would detonate with a remote detonator.

